  "purpose": "One reviewed membership-access batch with both app and Widget enforcement flags false. Existing beta access remains unchanged. The pure operation policy and private Widget snapshot have mandatory Swift verifiers. Expired access keeps existing memo editing and photo/history access; unknown access offers restore without granting access. Personal Widget expiry freezes selection rather than deleting photos; explicit manual selection and snapshot write failures retain their reviewed boundaries. This profile preserves all Build/privacy/disabled-billing checks, the existing Photos permission and scan path, runtime on both OS versions, and all three Widget Gallery lanes. Native app UI selects the new access-state operation and the existing personal rediscovery/history/visible-photo action operation. The workflow change is exactly the two-verifier addition; no other existing step changes. Native rendering and the changed Widget captures are not yet verified and must be reviewed from the run attachments. This is not purchase, main-promotion or TestFlight evidence by itself.",
